### Try the API right inside VS Code with the "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client):
### click "Send Request" above any block.

@base = http://localhost:4000/api
@token = paste-token-from-login-here

### Health check
GET http://localhost:4000/health

### Log in as the seeded admin (copy the "token" into @token above)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@example.com", "password": "admin12345" }

### Log in as the seeded customer
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "customer@example.com", "password": "customer123" }

### Register a new customer
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "New Person", "email": "new@example.com", "password": "password123" }

### Who am I?
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List products (filters: search, category, minPrice, maxPrice, inStock, sort, page, limit)
GET {{base}}/products?category=electronics&sort=price_asc

### Get one product
GET {{base}}/products/1

### List categories
GET {{base}}/categories

### [Admin] Create a product (prices are in cents: 2599 = $25.99)
POST {{base}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Desk Lamp", "description": "LED lamp", "priceCents": 2599, "stock": 12, "categoryId": 3 }

### Add to cart
POST {{base}}/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 }

### View cart
GET {{base}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Checkout (creates an order from the cart)
POST {{base}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shippingAddress": {
    "fullName": "Demo Customer",
    "line1": "123 Market St",
    "city": "San Francisco",
    "state": "CA",
    "postalCode": "94103",
    "country": "US"
  }
}

### My orders (admins see all orders)
GET {{base}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### [Admin] Mark order 1 as paid
PATCH {{base}}/orders/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "paid" }
